title: Omoide (想い出箱)
abstract: An interactive web application for remembering, celebrating, recording, and sharing birthdays and anniversaries, featuring 3D Omikuji fortunes, Keepsake card exports, Study Rooms with synchronized BGM, Zen Focus Pomodoro with ambient soundscapes, photo and video albums, community message boards, mini-games, and 13 seasonal and festival themes.
